  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Telawas Valley Cooperatives Union (Union des Coopratives de la Vallee de Telawas (UCVT))</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to construct a compound in Telawas that will be used as a distribution point for production inputs to its members and a collection center for their agricultural production. Funds will also finance the construction of a trading center in Agadez where the Union markets its produce. This expansion will enable UCVT members to reduce storage and transport losses and increase the volume of produce sold as well as the revenues earned by Union members.</narrative>
  </description>
